WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Manon dashes as Ryu falls from medium Dégagé in the corner.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.500
The first back heavy punch catches Ryu’s wake-up.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.570
Manon links another back heavy punch after the meaty hit.

4
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.000
Medium Renversé catches Ryu after the linked normals.

5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.600
The hit-grab ends in a hard knockdown and Manon’s medal counter shows two.
